    <entry>
      <title>butterfly主题部署心得</title>
      <link href="/2026/08/26/butterfly%E4%B8%BB%E9%A2%98%E9%83%A8%E7%BD%B2%E5%BF%83%E5%BE%97/"/>
      <url>/2026/08/26/butterfly%E4%B8%BB%E9%A2%98%E9%83%A8%E7%BD%B2%E5%BF%83%E5%BE%97/</url>
      
        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<p>记得刚开始学web时候看到学长的博客，暖色调十分唯美，还有动态打字效果，太酷了，被学长带着部署了一个hexo+github的博客，一开始简简单单选的cactus（仙人掌）主题，说是简洁高端大气上档次，但是自己还是想做一个像他们一样的页面。</p><p>现在把这个博客主题换了一下，github上也改了下，用了butterfly这个主题，改了半天终于差不多了，记录一下自己怎么搞的，忘了也看得懂，基础部署就不说了，主要是在butterfly主题的config.yml文件里操作。</p><h3 id="Menu"><a href="#Menu" class="headerlink" title="Menu"></a>Menu</h3><p>菜单，这里面没啥好说的，注意格式就行了，就主页有什么东西能点</p><figure class="highlight yaml"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="attr">menu:</span></span><br><span class="line">   <span class="string">主页:</span> <span class="string">/</span> <span class="string">||</span> <span class="string">fas</span> <span class="string">fa-home</span></span><br><span class="line">   <span class="string">关于:</span> <span class="string">/about/</span> <span class="string">||</span> <span class="string">fas</span> <span class="string">fa-user</span></span><br><span class="line">   <span class="string">归档:</span> <span class="string">/archives/</span> <span class="string">||</span> <span class="string">fa</span> <span class="string">fa-folder-open</span></span><br><span class="line">   <span class="string">标签:</span> <span class="string">/tags/</span> <span class="string">||</span> <span class="string">fa</span> <span class="string">fa-tags</span></span><br><span class="line">   <span class="string">友链:</span> <span class="string">/links/</span> <span class="string">||</span> <span class="string">fa</span> <span class="string">fa-link</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h3 id="Code-blocks"><a href="#Code-blocks" class="headerlink" title="Code blocks"></a>Code blocks</h3><p>代码块，终于知道那些好看的苹果风格代码块怎么来的了！</p><figure class="highlight yaml"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br><span class="line">11</span><br><span class="line">12</span><br><span class="line">13</span><br><span class="line">14</span><br><span class="line">15</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="attr">code_blocks:</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="comment"># 代码高亮主题：darker(暗色)/pale night(冷暗)/light(浅色)/ocean(海洋蓝)/false</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="attr">theme:</span> <span class="string">darker</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="comment"># mac窗口风格，true左上角显示红黄绿小圆点；false关闭</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="attr">macStyle:</span> <span class="literal">true</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="comment"># 代码块最大高度(px)，false=不限制高度全部展开</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="attr">height_limit:</span> <span class="literal">false</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="comment"># 代码自动换行：false超长出横向滚动条(保留代码格式)；true文字强制折行</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="attr">word_wrap:</span> <span class="literal">false</span></span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="comment"># 工具栏设置</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="attr">copy:</span> <span class="literal">true</span>        <span class="comment"># true开启代码复制按钮；false关闭</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="attr">language:</span> <span class="literal">true</span>    <span class="comment"># true显示右上角代码语言标识(css/python等)；false隐藏</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="attr">shrink:</span> <span class="literal">false</span>     <span class="comment"># true：默认折叠；false：默认展开；none：展开同时隐藏折叠按钮</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="attr">fullpage:</span> <span class="literal">false</span>   <span class="comment"># true开启代码全屏查看按钮；false关闭</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h3 id="Image-Settings"><a href="#Image-Settings" class="headerlink" title="Image Settings"></a>Image Settings</h3><p>最喜欢的图片部分，可自行下载。这里 <code>transparent</code> 可以理解为透明状态（找了半天才知道有这个），我的配置透明了一些部分，这样就只有头像、标签小图、和一个大背景图。</p><p>PS：可以去在线工具把图片裁成圆形等各种形状！</p><figure class="highlight yaml"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br><span class="line">11</span><br><span class="line">12</span><br><span class="line">13</span><br><span class="line">14</span><br><span class="line">15</span><br><span class="line">16</span><br><span class="line">17</span><br><span class="line">18</span><br><span class="line">19</span><br><span class="line">20</span><br><span class="line">21</span><br><span class="line">22</span><br><span class="line">23</span><br><span class="line">24</span><br><span class="line">25</span><br><span class="line">26</span><br><span class="line">27</span><br><span class="line">28</span><br><span class="line">29</span><br><span class="line">30</span><br><span class="line">31</span><br><span class="line">32</span><br><span class="line">33</span><br><span class="line">34</span><br><span class="line">35</span><br><span class="line">36</span><br><span class="line">37</span><br><span class="line">38</span><br><span class="line">39</span><br><span class="line">40</span><br><span class="line">41</span><br><span class="line">42</span><br><span class="line">43</span><br><span class="line">44</span><br><span class="line">45</span><br><span class="line">46</span><br><span class="line">47</span><br><span class="line">48</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="attr">favicon:</span> <span class="string">/img/xxx.jpg</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment"># 浏览器标签栏小图标，就是最上面左边的小图，我这是奶龙</span></span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="attr">avatar:</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="attr">img:</span> <span class="string">/img/xxx.jpg</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="attr">effect:</span> <span class="literal">false</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment"># 侧边栏头像</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment"># true就是头像一直转</span></span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment"># Disable all banner images</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment"># 是否全局关闭所有页面顶部横幅头图  false=不关闭，正常显示头图</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="attr">disable_top_img:</span> <span class="literal">false</span></span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment"># If the banner of page not setting, it will show the default_top_img</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment"># 当文章/分类/标签页面没有单独设置头图时，就使用这张兜底图片</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="attr">default_top_img:</span> <span class="string">transparent</span></span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment"># The banner image of index page</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment"># 【首页专属顶部横幅大图】 </span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="attr">index_img:</span> <span class="string">transparent</span></span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment"># The banner image of archive page</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment"># 归档页面的顶部横幅图，为空代表不单独设置，会使用上面 default_top_img 兜底</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="attr">archive_img:</span> <span class="literal">false</span></span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment"># <span class="doctag">Note:</span> tag page, not tags page</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment"># 标签总页面的顶部横幅图，为空则使用兜底图</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="attr">tag_img:</span> <span class="string">transparent</span></span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment"># The banner image of tag page, you can set the banner image for each tag</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment"># 给「单个标签」单独设置头图，可以给不同标签配不同横幅</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="attr">tag_per_img:</span> <span class="string">transparent</span></span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment"># <span class="doctag">Note:</span> category page, not categories page</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment"># 分类总页面的顶部横幅图，为空则使用兜底图</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="attr">category_img:</span> <span class="string">transparent</span></span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment"># The banner image of category page, you can set the banner image for each category</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment"># 给「单个分类」单独设置头图，可以给不同分类配不同横幅</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="attr">category_per_img:</span> <span class="string">transparent</span></span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment"># The background image of footer</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment"># 页脚（网站最底部）背景图 false=关闭，不使用背景图</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="attr">footer_img:</span> <span class="string">transparent</span></span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment"># Website Background  整个网站的背景图</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment"># Can set it to color, image URL or an array containing colors and/or image URLs</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="attr">background:</span> <span class="string">/img/dahai.jpg</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h3 id="Subtitle"><a href="#Subtitle" class="headerlink" title="Subtitle"></a>Subtitle</h3><p>副标题，主标题下面，可以开打字效果的那个，位于150行左右</p><figure class="highlight yaml"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="attr">subtitle:</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="attr">enable:</span> <span class="literal">true</span>          <span class="comment"># 是否开启副标题</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="attr">effect:</span> <span class="literal">true</span>          <span class="comment"># 是否开启打字机动画效果</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="attr">typed_option:</span>         <span class="comment"># typed.js打字机的高级参数，这里没填</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="attr">source:</span> <span class="literal">false</span>         <span class="comment"># 第三方API一言/古诗词接口</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="attr">sub:</span>                  <span class="comment"># 自己写的自定义文字，注意格式如下</span></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="bullet">-</span> <span class="string">日拱一卒无有尽，功不唐捐终入海</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h3 id="Announcement"><a href="#Announcement" class="headerlink" title="Announcement"></a>Announcement</h3><p>公告（全局config里语言设置为中文才知道这是公告），在Aside Settings里，位于300行左右</p><figure class="highlight yaml"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="attr">card_announcement:</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="attr">enable:</span> <span class="literal">true</span> </span><br><span class="line"><span class="attr">content:</span> <span class="string">--公告内容--</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h3 id="Background-effects"><a href="#Background-effects" class="headerlink" title="Background effects"></a>Background effects</h3><p>背景效果，这个还是很好玩的，**R(红)、G(绿)、B(蓝)**就是屏幕的光学三原色，850行左右</p><figure class="highlight yaml"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br><span class="line">11</span><br><span class="line">12</span><br><span class="line">13</span><br><span class="line">14</span><br><span class="line">15</span><br><span class="line">16</span><br><span class="line">17</span><br><span class="line">18</span><br><span class="line">19</span><br><span class="line">20</span><br><span class="line">21</span><br><span class="line">22</span><br><span class="line">23</span><br><span class="line">24</span><br><span class="line">25</span><br><span class="line">26</span><br><span class="line">27</span><br><span class="line">28</span><br><span class="line">29</span><br><span class="line">30</span><br><span class="line">31</span><br><span class="line">32</span><br><span class="line">33</span><br><span class="line">34</span><br><span class="line">35</span><br><span class="line">36</span><br><span class="line">37</span><br><span class="line">38</span><br><span class="line">39</span><br><span class="line">40</span><br><span class="line">41</span><br><span class="line">42</span><br><span class="line">43</span><br><span class="line">44</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="comment"># 静止彩带背景</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="attr">canvas_ribbon:</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="attr">enable:</span> <span class="literal">false</span>          <span class="comment"># false关闭；true开启静态飘带彩带</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="attr">size:</span> <span class="number">150</span>              <span class="comment"># 彩带大小</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="attr">alpha:</span> <span class="number">0.6</span>             <span class="comment"># 透明度</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="attr">zIndex:</span> <span class="number">-1</span>             <span class="comment"># 层级，-1放到页面内容后面当背景</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="attr">click_to_change:</span> <span class="literal">false</span> <span class="comment"># 点击页面切换彩带</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="attr">mobile:</span> <span class="literal">false</span>          <span class="comment"># 手机端是否启用</span></span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment"># 动态飘动彩带</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="attr">canvas_fluttering_ribbon:</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="attr">enable:</span> <span class="literal">true</span>       <span class="comment"># 页面会有飘动的彩色丝带效果</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="attr">mobile:</span> <span class="literal">true</span>       <span class="comment"># 手机上也显示彩带</span></span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment"># 粒子连线背景（常见蜘蛛网效果）</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="attr">canvas_nest:</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="attr">enable:</span> <span class="literal">true</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="attr">color:</span> <span class="string">&#x27;0,0,255&#x27;</span>   <span class="comment"># 连线颜色RGB (三原色) </span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="attr">opacity:</span> <span class="number">0.7</span>       <span class="comment"># 透明度范围 (0~1)</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="attr">zIndex:</span> <span class="number">-1</span>         <span class="comment"># 背景网页层级，默认-1</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="attr">count:</span> <span class="number">99</span>          <span class="comment"># 粒子数量，数字越多越卡</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="attr">mobile:</span> <span class="literal">false</span>      <span class="comment"># 手机</span></span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment"># 点击鼠标烟花效果</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="attr">fireworks:</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="attr">enable:</span> <span class="literal">false</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="attr">zIndex:</span> <span class="number">9999</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="attr">mobile:</span> <span class="literal">false</span></span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment"># 点击鼠标弹出爱心</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="attr">click_heart:</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="attr">enable:</span> <span class="literal">false</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="attr">mobile:</span> <span class="literal">false</span></span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment"># 点击鼠标弹出自定义文字</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="attr">clickShowText:</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="attr">enable:</span> <span class="literal">false</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="attr">text:</span></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="comment"># - I</span></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="comment"># - LOVE</span></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="comment"># - YOU</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="attr">fontSize:</span> <span class="string">15px</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="attr">random:</span> <span class="literal">false</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="attr">mobile:</span> <span class="literal">false</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h3 id="inject"><a href="#inject" class="headerlink" title="inject"></a>inject</h3><p><code>inject</code> 是butterfly里非常重要的代码注入功能，不用修改主题原始文件，把自定义 CSS、JS、HTML 插入网页里，升级主题的时候你的修改不会丢失，写的时候注意格式。</p><p>下面是我用的，主要功能是给卡片加上透明模糊效果（有其它效果可见：<a href="https://www.luotian.cyou/post/custom-beautify.html">hexo 博客自定义美化配置 — butterfly 主题</a>）。但透明度太低会看不清文字，于是下方加入了让文字强制保持颜色的功能。</p><figure class="highlight yaml"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br><span class="line">11</span><br><span class="line">12</span><br><span class="line">13</span><br><span class="line">14</span><br><span class="line">15</span><br><span class="line">16</span><br><span class="line">17</span><br><span class="line">18</span><br><span class="line">19</span><br><span class="line">20</span><br><span class="line">21</span><br><span class="line">22</span><br><span class="line">23</span><br><span class="line">24</span><br><span class="line">25</span><br><span class="line">26</span><br><span class="line">27</span><br><span class="line">28</span><br><span class="line">29</span><br><span class="line">30</span><br><span class="line">31</span><br><span class="line">32</span><br><span class="line">33</span><br><span class="line">34</span><br><span class="line">35</span><br><span class="line">36</span><br><span class="line">37</span><br><span class="line">38</span><br><span class="line">39</span><br><span class="line">40</span><br><span class="line">41</span><br><span class="line">42</span><br><span class="line">43</span><br><span class="line">44</span><br><span class="line">45</span><br><span class="line">46</span><br><span class="line">47</span><br><span class="line">48</span><br><span class="line">49</span><br><span class="line">50</span><br><span class="line">51</span><br><span class="line">52</span><br><span class="line">53</span><br><span class="line">54</span><br><span class="line">55</span><br><span class="line">56</span><br><span class="line">57</span><br><span class="line">58</span><br><span class="line">59</span><br><span class="line">60</span><br><span class="line">61</span><br><span class="line">62</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="comment"># Inject</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment"># Insert the code to head (before &#x27;&lt;/head&gt;&#x27; tag) and the bottom (before &#x27;&lt;/body&gt;&#x27; tag)</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="attr">inject:</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="attr">head:</span></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="comment"># - &lt;link rel=&quot;stylesheet&quot; href=&quot;/xxx.css&quot;&gt;</span></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="comment"># 改透明度，俩background参数的最后一位，深色浅色为0.8和0.6比较好，越小越浅色</span></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="comment"># 删掉了backgroung上一行的   #page-header #post-info  不要把文章标题覆盖了</span></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="bullet">-</span> <span class="string">|</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="string">      &lt;style&gt;</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="string">        /* 明亮模式 */</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="string">        #body-wrap #recent-posts &gt; .recent-post-item,</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="string">        #body-wrap .recent-post-item,</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="string">        #body-wrap #aside-content .card-widget,</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="string">        #body-wrap .layout &gt; div:first-child:not(.recent-posts),</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="string">        #body-wrap #nav .menus_items .menus_item .menus_item_child,</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="string">        #body-wrap #pagination .page-number:not(.current),</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="string">        #body-wrap #pagination .extend &#123;</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="string">            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8);</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="string">            backdrop-filter: blur(2px);</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="string">            -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(2px);</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="string">            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.85);</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="string">            box-shadow: 0 8px 16px -4px rgba(138, 138, 138, 0.15);</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="string">            transition: background 0.3s ease, border 0.3s ease, box-shadow 0.3s ease;</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="string">        &#125;</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="string">        #body-wrap #pagination .page-number:not(.current):hover,</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="string">        #body-wrap #pagination .extend:hover &#123;</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="string">            background: #ff7142d2;</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="string">            border-color: #ff7142d2;</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="string">            color: #fff;</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="string">        &#125;</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="string">        /* 夜间模式 */</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="string">        html[data-theme=&quot;dark&quot;] #body-wrap #recent-posts &gt; .recent-post-item,</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="string">        html[data-theme=&quot;dark&quot;] #body-wrap .recent-post-item,</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="string">        html[data-theme=&quot;dark&quot;] #body-wrap #aside-content .card-widget,</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="string">        html[data-theme=&quot;dark&quot;] #body-wrap .layout &gt; div:first-child:not(.recent-posts),</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="string">        html[data-theme=&quot;dark&quot;] #body-wrap #nav .menus_items .menus_item .menus_item_child,</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="string">        html[data-theme=&quot;dark&quot;] #body-wrap #pagination .page-number:not(.current),</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="string">        html[data-theme=&quot;dark&quot;] #body-wrap #pagination .extend &#123;</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="string">            background: rgba(30, 30, 30, 0.6);</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="string">            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="string">            box-shadow: 0 8px 16px -4px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2);</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="string">        &#125;</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="string">        /*亮色模式强制文字颜色*/</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="string">        .recent-post-item .article-title&#123;</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="string">          color:#111 !important;</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="string">        &#125;</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="string">        .recent-post-item .article-meta-wrap,</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="string">        .recent-post-item .content&#123;</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="string">            color:#222 !important;</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="string">        &#125;</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="string">        /*夜间模式文字颜色*/</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="string">        html[data-theme=&quot;dark&quot;] .recent-post-item .article-title&#123;</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="string">          color:#f1f1f1 !important;</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="string">        &#125;</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="string">        html[data-theme=&quot;dark&quot;] .recent-post-item .article-meta-wrap,</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="string">        html[data-theme=&quot;dark&quot;] .recent-post-item .content&#123;</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="string">          color:#dddddd !important;</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="string">        &#125;</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="string">      &lt;/style&gt;</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="string"></span>  <span class="attr">bottom:</span></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="comment"># - &lt;script src=&quot;xxxx&quot;&gt;&lt;/script&gt;</span></span><br><span class="line"></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>还有一些search什么的设置就不写出来了，反正config.yml文件里面有什么不懂的，问豆包就行了。</p>]]></content>
      
      
      
